<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Delhi to Jaipur Car Transport Cost | Shifting Rates Guide
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the car transport cost calculated for a Delhi to Jaipur move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is derived from a blend of fixed and variable components. Fixed fees include base freight, loading equipment, and insurance premiums, while variable elements cover fuel surcharge, distance‑based mileage, GST, and any special handling requirements. Shree Ashirwad’s transparent tariff ensures every charge is itemised, so you know exactly what you pay for packers and movers delhi to jaipur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a vehicle traveling from Delhi to Jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions on NH 19, a professional carrier completes the 309 km journey in 6‑8 hours. Expressway logistics, real‑time GPS tracking, and dedicated hydraulic ramps help maintain this window. Delays may occur due to peak‑hour congestion, weather, or unforeseen roadwork, but reputable packers and movers delhi to jaipur plan buffers to keep you informed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need insurance for my car during the relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, insurance is mandatory for any inter‑city vehicle transport. Shree Ashirwad provides 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering theft, accidental damage, and natural hazards. You can also opt for higher coverage levels if you own a premium or classic vehicle. The policy cost is included in the final quote and clearly listed in the tariff breakdown.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle while it is in transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck in the Shree Ashirwad fleet is equipped with satellite GPS that offers live location updates through a secure client portal. You receive real‑time alerts for departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival at the destination depot. This tracking feature is a standard part of the service for packers and movers delhi to jaipur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to move my car from Delhi to Jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate (RC), a valid insurance copy, a government‑issued photo ID, the e‑Way bill generated for the shipment, and a signed loading checklist. For corporate or government transfers, additional GST invoices may be required. Shree Ashirwad’s team assists in preparing and verifying each document to avoid RTO hold‑ups.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I avoid hidden charges when hiring packers and movers for Delhi‑Jaipur relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Choose a mover with a transparent tariff sheet that lists every line item, including fuel surcharge, insurance, loading equipment, and GST. Beware of vague “service fees” or “handling charges” that appear only after loading. Shree Ashirwad provides a complete cost matrix up front, and any extra service—like extra padding or overnight storage—is pre‑approved before execution.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad a reliable choice among packers and movers delhi to jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">With over 15 years of experience, ISO 9001:2015 certification, and a fleet of 120+ specialised container trucks, the company offers end‑to‑end reliability. Their 4.9/5 Google rating reflects consistent on‑time delivery, robust insurance, live GPS tracking, and compliance with IBA mover code. These credentials set them apart from generic wooden packers in delhi or unverified local operators.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
